# Sisyphus evidence: Git cannot re-include files under an ignored parent.
# Keep this ladder and the root catch-all below so review text stays trackable.
.sisyphus/*
!.sisyphus/evidence/
.sisyphus/evidence/*
!.sisyphus/evidence/ux-walkthrough/
.sisyphus/evidence/ux-walkthrough/*
!.sisyphus/evidence/ux-walkthrough/*/
